- `AIModelSettings.vue`: a basic CSV input exists. Replace it with a dedicated, reusable `TagsManager.vue` (add/remove chips, suggestions, dedupe), wired via `v-model="model.tags"`.

**Dependencies & Risks:**
- `Selector` is shared → tag filtering must be opt-in (`enableTagFilter`) to avoid affecting the profile selector.
